WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740
At one moment in a Catholic
Mass, a bell may ring.

2
00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:07.930
The priest raises a small
white host, and people kneel.

3
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.770
Catholics believe the bread is
now truly the Body of Christ,

4
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.600
though it still looks
and tastes like bread.

5
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:17.520
They also call the Mass a sacrifice.

6
00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.140
Yet Jesus died on the
cross once, long ago.

7
00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:25.360
So what happens at Mass,
step by step, and why?

8
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:30.040
In this mission, you'll follow the Mass
from opening hymn to final blessing.

9
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.210
Then you'll see why a lamp
burns beside the tabernacle,

10
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.450
and why Catholics bend
the knee as they pass.

11
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.380
Your mission: find out
what happens at Mass,

12
00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.670
step by step, and what Catholics
mean when they call it a sacrifice.
